  i Vue 3 ignores this option. v-model on a component always uses the modelValue prop and the update:modelValue event.
  
  i Rename the prop to modelValue and emit update:modelValue, or keep the prop name and use a named v-model such as v-model:checked. See the Vue 3 migration guide for more information.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

